data: {"type":"text","content":"Here's what's left from today and what slipped. Which are done? The rest goes on Thursday's On deck unless you say otherwise.\n\n- Ship the phone API report (critical, today)\n- Fix the plan tab refresh\n- Pair on the seed data\n- Order printer ink\n- Laundry (evening)\n- Sketch the notification copy (On deck)\n- Tidy the downloads folder (On deck)\n- Review the sync PR (from Tue 3 Nov)\n- Book the dentist (from Tue 3 Nov)\n- Plan the phone beta (week list, 2h) — stays on the week unless you want it moved\n\nFor Thursday itself: no meetings on the calendar (it couldn't be read, so I can't judge how booked the day is), and \"Prepare the demo\" is already on Thursday's list. Anything for Thursday evening? And anything to add for Thursday — Context still has \"Phone alpha week\" in force through Sat 7 Nov."}

